    "Id": "chassisdef_uberjager_UJ9-A1",
    "Name": "Uberjager",
    "Details": "The first Uberjager, the -A1 mounts a total of six Ultra Autocannon 2, with two ER Large Lasers as support. The design was found lacking in raw damage and being too reliant on its weapons repeatedly actually hitting its enemies, which lead to future designs more focused on higher caliber weapons.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Ballistics</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.27</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
